---
import AccountLayout from "../layouts/AccountLayout.astro";import "../styles/workspace-tools.css";
---
<AccountLayout title="Asset Tracker" current="assets"><header class="portal-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">A home for your equipment</div><h1>Asset Tracker</h1><p>Track identification, assignment, movement and maintenance with a permanent history.</p></div></header><p id="asset-plan" class="workspace-plan"></p><p id="asset-status" class="workspace-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="workspace-grid"><section class="workspace-panel"><h2 id="asset-edit-title">Create an asset</h2><form id="asset-save"><fieldset id="asset-fields" disabled><div class="workspace-form"><label>Asset identification number<input id="asset-code" maxlength="80" pattern="[A-Z0-9][A-Z0-9_.-]*" required /><small>Uppercase internal code; not a registered GS1 GTIN.</small></label><label>Name<input id="asset-name" maxlength="200" required /></label><label class="wide">Description<textarea id="asset-description" maxlength="4000"></textarea></label><label>Location<input id="asset-location" maxlength="200" /></label><label>Assigned personnel<input id="asset-person" maxlength="200" /></label><label>Acquired on<input id="asset-date" type="date" /></label><label>Purchase value<input id="asset-price" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" /></label><label>Currency<select id="asset-currency"><option>USD</option><option>EUR</option><option>GBP</option></select></label><label>Condition<select id="asset-condition"><option value="new">New</option><option value="good" selected>Good</option><option value="fair">Fair</option><option value="poor">Poor</option><option value="damaged">Damaged</option></select></label><label class="wide">Link a catalogue product (optional)<select id="asset-product"><option value="">No product link</option></select></label><div class="workspace-actions wide"><button type="submit" class="button button-signal">Save asset</button><button type="button" id="asset-new" class="button button-secondary">New asset</button></div></div></fieldset></form></section><section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Record an action</h2><p id="asset-selected">Select an asset below.</p><form id="asset-action"><fieldset id="asset-action-fields" disabled><div class="workspace-form"><label>Action<select id="asset-action-type"><option value="checkout">Check out</option><option value="checkin">Check in</option><option value="move">Move location</option><option value="maintenance">Maintenance record</option><option value="retire">Retire</option><option value="restore">Restore</option></select></label><label>Event date (optional)<input id="asset-event-date" type="date" /></label><label>Check out to<input id="asset-checkout-person" maxlength="200" /></label><label>Destination location<input id="asset-destination" maxlength="200" /></label><label class="wide">History note<textarea id="asset-note" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><button type="submit" class="button button-signal">Record action</button></div></fieldset></form><p>Check an asset in before retiring it. Retired assets remain in your register. Changes are recorded with before/after details.</p><h3>Print an asset label</h3><label class="workspace-field">Saved design<select id="asset-template"><option value="">Default 100 × 50mm</option></select></label><label class="workspace-field">Default symbol<select id="asset-symbol"><option value="barcode">Code 128</option><option value="qr">QR Code</option></select></label><div class="workspace-actions">{["pdf","png","svg"].map(format=><button type="button" class="button button-secondary" data-asset-label={format} disabled>Export label {format.toUpperCase()}</button>)}</div><a href="/label-studio/">Create reusable label designs</a></section></div><section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Asset register</h2><form id="asset-search" class="workspace-form"><label>Name, asset code or person<input id="asset-q" type="search" maxlength="200" /></label><label>Status<select id="asset-filter-status"><option value="">All</option><option value="available">Available</option><option value="checked_out">Checked out</option><option value="retired">Retired</option></select></label><label>Location<input id="asset-filter-location" maxlength="200" /></label><button type="submit" class="button button-secondary">Search</button></form><div class="workspace-actions">{["csv","xlsx","json"].map(format=><button type="button" class="button button-secondary" data-asset-export={format}>Export register {format.toUpperCase()}</button>)}</div><div class="workspace-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Assets"><table class="workspace-table"><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Name</th><th>Location</th><th>Assigned / checked out to</th><th>Condition / status</th><th>Review</th></tr></thead><tbody id="asset-rows"></tbody></table></div><div class="workspace-actions"><button type="button" id="asset-prev" class="button button-secondary">Previous</button><span id="asset-page"></span><button type="button" id="asset-next" class="button button-secondary">Next</button></div></section><section id="asset-history" class="workspace-panel" hidden><h2>Asset history</h2><div id="asset-history-items"></div><div class="workspace-actions"><button type="button" id="asset-history-prev" class="button button-secondary">Previous</button><span id="asset-history-page"></span><button type="button" id="asset-history-next" class="button button-secondary">Next</button></div></section></AccountLayout>
<script src="../scripts/assets.ts"></script>
